 record for Randolph County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair ran 38% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 30%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 31% and April to May at 43% on the middle.</p>"}
